{
  "about": "Formatting HTML as the help center renders it (server/internal/helpcenter/formatting_test.go) and as the editor preview shows it (web/src/features/kb/markdown-preview.test.tsx, which compares the elements, classes and text, without heading ids). docs/internals/knowledge-base.md shows the forms.",
